[{"client_msg_id":"a6ffcabf-7cb5-4ae1-863f-11cb0bb3bf37","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/melpa/melpa/pull/7496#issuecomment-805158349\u003e\nちなみにyaml.elがMELPAに提案されたときのtarsiusさんの喜びようが良かったですね。\n誰かやってくれないかなーってずっと待ってたみたいでした。","ts":"1625021316.325600","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/melpa/melpa/pull/7496#issuecomment-805158349|Comment on #7496 Add recipe for yaml\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/melpa/melpa/pull/7496#issuecomment-805158349|Comment on #7496 Add recipe for yaml\u003e","text":"\u0026gt; yaml.el is a YAML parser written in Emacs List without any external dependencies.\n\nFinally! :grinning:  \n\u003chttps://github.com/magit/forge/blob/f4c95dd0e633b3dd332d6f91122c864ab3640912/lisp/forge-topic.el#L770-L772|https://github.com/magit/forge/blob/f4c95dd0e633b3dd332d6f91122c864ab3640912/lisp/forge-topic.el#L770-L772\u003e","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/melpa/melpa|melpa/melpa\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1616526338}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U7JL1UKKL","UFHQ7TNT0"]},{"name":"kawaii","count":2,"users":["U023KQQKC6T","U022TD5GGKE"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fm2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"127ab07a-c460-4604-846c-ed4f3cca3a39","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ですね。我々だけの世界で完結してるならS式をそのままprin1してreadすれば簡単に永続化できるので。\nただまぁ他の世界とコミュニケーションするにはyamlとかjsonとか、色々必要ですよねー。って感じです。","ts":"1625021092.325400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vcfu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"27993de9-494e-4280-8b98-0e4ece499100","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"いや連携に必要なだけか","ts":"1625020769.325200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"swx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b30910a0-3c1d-4a80-a335-b7d8691acffe","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"EmacserでもYAML使うんだ","ts":"1625020714.325100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yyFO5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b71eaae-7ad4-4113-befa-d3777a0dbc79","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"yaml.el、本家に取り込んで欲しい。","ts":"1625017514.324800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vqGMr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"28049d50-73ef-4467-b528-d4ed9f5e7399","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://melpa.org/#/yaml\u003e\nforgeが依存してますね。","ts":"1625017486.324500","attachments":[{"fallback":"MELPA","id":1,"title":"MELPA","title_link":"https://melpa.org/#/yaml","text":"The largest and most up-to-date repository of Emacs packages.","blocks":null,"service_name":"melpa.org","service_icon":"https://melpa.org/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://melpa.org/#/yaml","original_url":"https://melpa.org/#/yaml"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+sQfB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c96951e-023f-4755-b0c7-dff47c964930","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"パッケージのアップデートしたら、何かのパッケージ依存で yaml.el が追加された\n\u003chttps://github.com/zkry/yaml.el\u003e","ts":"1625017221.324200","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"zkry/yaml.el","id":1,"title":"zkry/yaml.el","text":"YAML parser in Elisp","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"14","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Emacs Lisp","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wqu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f8246d9-3fca-4e60-b9a0-2446c7e6f1fb","type":"message","user":"U023KQQKC6T","text":"あーたしかに","ts":"1625016867.323600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"muCx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"36568765-7aed-4ae7-bca1-6b544a2ba50d","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"NULがあるとバイナリ判定。みたいな。","ts":"1625016743.323400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s5V7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c1ea2960-df11-4f3f-8282-9894bcaf5761","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"^@はNULなので、やばそうではあります。","ts":"1625016723.323200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lcN6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0eb0e29e-a36d-4501-bb1d-dba0a171fb2f","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"んーなるほど。(Emacsの表記が。。普通にhexで表示してくれればいいのに)","ts":"1625016678.323000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Esg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"44a3bedd-f184-4fda-b148-94c741088b9f","type":"message","user":"U023KQQKC6T","text":"とりあえず git / github 用なら .gitattribute で指定するとテキストファイル扱いになるはず","ts":"1625016633.322800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"deYkv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"297b8550-bbe2-4c86-b369-34b723e2a91e","type":"message","user":"U023KQQKC6T","text":"この状態なら `bv.el: Lisp/Scheme program text, ASCII text` になりますね","ts":"1625016611.322300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Eio"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be70238d-fd66-4344-a582-10055bcb51a4","type":"message","user":"U023KQQKC6T","text":"```❯ diff -au ./bv\\ \\(1\\).el bv.el\n--- ./bv (1).el 2021-06-30 10:28:30.000000000 +0900\n+++ bv.el       2021-06-30 10:29:16.000000000 +0900\n@@ -88,13 +88,10 @@\n\n Example:\n   (bv-from-hex \\\"0\\\")\n-  ;;=\u0026gt; #\u0026amp;4\\\"\\\"\n\n   (bv-from-hex \\\"7\\\")\n-  ;;=\u0026gt; #\u0026amp;4\\\"\\\"\n\n   (bv-from-hex \\\"f\\\")\n-  ;;=\u0026gt; #\u0026amp;4\\\"\\\"\n\n   (bv-from-hex \\\"21\\\")\n   ;;=\u0026gt; #\u0026amp;8\\\"!\\\"\"```","ts":"1625016593.321900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e11W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"132971d2-522e-4418-8b6a-cc8e4ef789c0","type":"message","user":"U023KQQKC6T","text":"^@ とかもかな","ts":"1625016545.321500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"st1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"effef869-1e38-431c-ba82-234c4bdab247","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"^Lはいつも使ってるコードなんですよね。なんだろう。。","ts":"1625016530.321300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I5mc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cce5cf4b-d362-4b6e-af62-195c21e6afa6","type":"message","user":"U023KQQKC6T","text":"そういうことではないよう","ts":"1625016446.321100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"crT9u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1f97d087-51ac-4501-ad8e-bf425114d145","type":"message","user":"U023KQQKC6T","text":"^L がわりと早い位置にあるからとか","ts":"1625016434.320900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZJ/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"747d7c69-a36a-4779-a937-abda7576d258","type":"message","user":"U023KQQKC6T","text":"file に渡しても\n```❯ file ./bv.el\n./bv.el: data```\nといわれるよう","ts":"1625016427.320600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SVIN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"BF5CBF88-D92A-4CD1-BA5F-2ECD6C813339","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"ほんとですね。なんでだろう:thinking_face:","ts":"1625014991.320100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qej"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2262fd89-93a9-4a26-9437-2c428f344920","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"なぜかbv.elが